APPLIED ENERGISTICS 2

Controller+ is an independent add-on for Applied Energistics 2 (AE2). AE2 is
developed by the Applied Energistics team and is distributed under its own
licenses. AE2 is a separate runtime dependency and is not included in the
Controller+ JAR.

The self-powered controller block textures
(assets/controllerplus/textures/block/self_powered_controller*.png) are
adapted from AE2's controller texture templates (controller.png,
controller_powered.png, controller_lights.png in AE2 26.1.8-alpha). The face
layout and connector cutouts follow AE2's original template; the surface
colors and the animated rainbow emissive strip are original, substituted from
vanilla Minecraft block colors. The original AE2 textures are copyright the
Applied Energistics contributors and are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0.
Controller+'s modified textures are distributed under the same license.

No AE2 source code is copied into Controller+. See docs/AE2_INTEGRATION.md
(kept locally, not part of version control) for the implementation-level
integration notes.

Any exact, unmodified AE2 or third-party files retained locally for
development reference (see local-reference/) are not part of Controller+ and
are excluded from version control.

